{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"5ye_fwj_neh","canonical_person_id":"5ye_fwj_neh","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["5ye_fwj_neh"],"persons":[{"id":"5ye_fwj_neh","label":"陳文帝蒨","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-021","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong","source_id":"s-nanshi-021-wangchong-ws1752646","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p003","quote":"文帝","kind":"person_reference","mention_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p003:r0047"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"依南史21、陳書本傳及其本紀的具名或稱謂身份，互證檔保留完整固定原證。"}],"source_mention_summary":[],"most_mentioned_source_ids":[],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"id":"c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong:p001:r0015","surface":"世祖","start":15,"end":17,"person_id":"5ye_fwj_neh","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong:p001","quote":"廢帝諱伯宗，字奉業，小字藥王，世祖嫡長子也。","note":"本紀傳主之父。","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong","book_id":"b-chenshu-004","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong-ws8231316"},{"start":47,"end":49,"surface":"文帝","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p003:r0047","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p003","person_id":"5ye_fwj_neh","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"陳武帝受禪，領太子少傅，加特進、左光祿大夫，領丹陽尹，參撰律令。帝以沖前代舊臣，特申長幼之敬。文帝即位，益加尊重，嘗從幸司空徐度宅，宴筵之上，賜以幾。光大元年薨，年七十六，贈司空，諡曰元簡。","note":"本句按敘述視點回指陳文。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong","book_id":"b-nanshi-021","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-021-wangchong-ws1752646"},{"start":41,"end":43,"surface":"文帝","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001:r0041","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001","person_id":"5ye_fwj_neh","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"瑒字子瑛，沈靜有器局，美風儀。梁元帝時，位太子中庶子。陳武帝入輔，以爲司徒左長史。文帝即位，累遷太子中庶子、散騎常侍、侍中。父沖嘗爲瑒辭領中庶子，文帝顧沖曰：「所以久留瑒于承華，正欲使太子微有瑒風法耳。」","note":"本句按敘述視點回指陳文。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyang","book_id":"b-nanshi-021","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-021-wangyang-ws1752646"},{"start":73,"end":75,"surface":"文帝","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001:r0073","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001","person_id":"5ye_fwj_neh","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"瑒字子瑛，沈靜有器局，美風儀。梁元帝時，位太子中庶子。陳武帝入輔，以爲司徒左長史。文帝即位，累遷太子中庶子、散騎常侍、侍中。父沖嘗爲瑒辭領中庶子，文帝顧沖曰：「所以久留瑒于承華，正欲使太子微有瑒風法耳。」","note":"本句按敘述視點回指陳文。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyang","book_id":"b-nanshi-021","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-021-wangyang-ws1752646"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian:p002:r0050","surface":"文帝","start":50,"end":52,"person_id":"5ye_fwj_neh","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian:p002","quote":"承聖元年，為太子中庶子，遷尋陽太守。魏克荊州，固之鄱陽，隨兄質度東嶺，居信安縣。陳永定中，移居吳郡。文帝以固清靜，且欲申以婚姻。天嘉中，歷位中書令，散騎常侍，國子祭酒。以其女為皇太子妃，禮遇甚重。","note":"按傳主、各朝年月、明文親稱與皇太子世系。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian-ws2478204"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzhi-zizhen:p003:r0082","surface":"文帝","start":82,"end":84,"person_id":"5ye_fwj_neh","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzhi-zizhen:p003","quote":"魏平荊州，侯瑱鎮盆城，與質不協，質率所部依於留異。陳永定二年，武帝命質率所部隨都督周文育討王琳。質與琳素善，或譖雲於軍中潛信交通，武帝命文育殺質，文育啟救之，獲免。文帝嗣位，以為五兵尚書。宣帝輔政，為司徒左長史。坐招聚博徒，免官。後為都官尚書。卒，諡曰安子。弟固。","note":"辨梁、陳兩武帝與陳世祖、高宗。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzhi-zizhen","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangzhi-zizhen-ws2478204"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong:p001","text":"廢帝諱伯宗，字奉業，小字藥王，世祖嫡長子也。","mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong:p001:m0003","surface":"伯宗","start":3,"end":5,"person_id":"2mj_6rl_6xs","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong:p001:m0007","surface":"奉業","start":7,"end":9,"person_id":"2mj_6rl_6xs","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong:p001:m0012","surface":"藥王","start":12,"end":14,"person_id":"2mj_6rl_6xs","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":8231316,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":10,"last_line":10,"line_start":2,"line_end":24,"raw_start":148,"raw_end":170,"raw_character_offsets":[148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169],"projection_sha256":"001d472fac0658da2bc6f583661b93c7332769c3b9ab16e1b72d17a169ff6dc5"},"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong","book_id":"b-chenshu-004","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong-ws8231316"},{"id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p003","text":"陳武帝受禪，領太子少傅，加特進、左光祿大夫，領丹陽尹，參撰律令。帝以沖前代舊臣，特申長幼之敬。文帝即位，益加尊重，嘗從幸司空徐度宅，宴筵之上，賜以幾。光大元年薨，年七十六，贈司空，諡曰元簡。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":34,"end":35,"surface":"沖","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p003:m0034","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provision